      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/30 p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white"><a href="/tattoo-meaning/animals/wolf-tattoo-meaning/" class="text-accent-400 hover:underline">Wolf</a></h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Loyalty, family, instinct, protection, freedom.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/30 p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white"><a href="/tattoo-meaning/animals/lion-tattoo-meaning/" class="text-accent-400 hover:underline">Lion</a></h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Courage, royalty, strength, leadership, pride.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/30 p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white"><a href="/tattoo-meaning/animals/snake-tattoo-meaning/" class="text-accent-400 hover:underline">Snake</a></h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Transformation, rebirth, healing, temptation, wisdom.</p></div>
