        <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/30 p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white"><a href="/tattoo-meaning/flowers/cherry-blossom-tattoo-meaning/" class="text-accent-400 hover:underline">Cherry Blossom</a></h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Mortality, beauty, renewal, fleeting nature of life.</p></div>
