        <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/30 p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white"><a href="/tattoo-meaning/mythological/koi-fish-tattoo-meaning/" class="text-accent-400 hover:underline">Koi Fish</a></h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Perseverance, determination, ambition, good fortune.</p></div>
