        <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/30 p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white"><a href="/tattoo-meaning/nature/wave-tattoo-meaning/" class="text-accent-400 hover:underline">Wave</a></h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Power, change, flow of life, resilience, freedom.</p></div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/30 p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white"><a href="/tattoo-meaning/objects/anchor-tattoo-meaning/" class="text-accent-400 hover:underline">Anchor</a></h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Stability, hope, steadfastness, maritime tradition, grounding.</p></div>
