        <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-800 bg-ink-900/30 p-4"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white"><a href="/tattoo-meaning/birds/swallow-tattoo-meaning/" class="text-accent-400 hover:underline">Swallow</a></h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-400">Loyalty, return, hope, a sailor's journey home.</p></div>
